      <activity id="84c0e393-3ef4-5840-aea8-609f3c817ac2" activityNameId="f15bcf63-5945-5c46-96d7-7cee82cbc0dc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Open ground construction, on ground</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Open ground construction, on ground
Production of the additional components necessary for the mounting of 1 m2 PV panel or laminate.;
UUID: 147fc5bd-292c-3f6c-87b8-19de33863ef6
Materials and packaging for the production and estimation for metal processing. Disposal of the product after use. Energy use for the construction process must be included in data of the PV-plant.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: Construction parts for a photovoltaic system.
Time period: Date of data investigation.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from manufacturers 
Extrapolations: From several products to the whole market.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_147fc5bd-292c-3f6c-87b8-19de33863ef6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
